  "description": "Lundi 20 Cargo 5 is the most intuitive and pleasant version to ride in the entire cargo family, thanks to its continuously variable Enviolo HD transmission. This system allows seamless, progressive gear changes—whether you're pedalling or not, even when stopped. Just a simple twist of the grip adjusts your effort to the situation: start smoothly, climb hills with ease, or accelerate effortlessly. And for those who don't want to get their hands dirty, who park their bike outdoors, or prefer low maintenance, the chain is replaced by a belt—fully enclosed in a protective cover! Top marks for safety and convenience!",
